title: "restoration-forensics-attribution: evaluation code, training configurations and aggregate results for deployment-centric attribution of forensic-detector changes after image restoration"
abstract: "Evaluation utilities, synthetic demonstrations, training configurations of 160 fingerprint detector runs and aggregate results accompanying the manuscript 'Evaluating Forensic Detectors After Image Restoration: A Deployment-Centric Attribution Framework' (prepared for submission to Pattern Recognition; not yet published)."
